# VMS-41R1 qualification-pack builder checklist

- [ ] Reads the single real Solver export read-only and verifies it is not a VMS-41 source ID.
- [ ] Writes only a fresh `qualification_fixtures/vms41r1/` pack and refuses unsafe or existing destinations.
- [ ] Binds every public and hidden member through `pack-manifest.json` byte size and SHA-256.
- [ ] Reproduces the two frozen protocol identities and hashes without restoring retired root directories.
- [ ] Resolves protocol bytes only from canonical moved files or the pinned pre-reconstruction Git commit.
- [ ] Freezes exactly six cases, six attempt IDs, thresholds, blind-review rubric and explicit nonclaims.
- [ ] Keeps hidden acceptable sets and reference candidates out of per-case public input manifests.
- [ ] Replays all reference candidates to `PENDING_BLIND_MANUAL_AUDIT` with mechanical PASS.
- [ ] Replays negative mutations as stable FAIL/INVALID without learning expected values.
- [ ] Imports no model, Solver, database, network or subprocess client.
